.TH DR-CHARM 1 "2026-08-26" "dr-charm 0.0.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dr-charm \- DragonRealms terminal client
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dr-charm
.RB [ -config " " \fIPATH\fR ]
.br
.B dr-charm
.B -version
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dr-charm
authenticates to DragonRealms and renders a terminal interface.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI -config " PATH"
Read credentials from PATH instead of the default configuration locations.
.TP
.B -version
Print the installed version without reading configuration or opening a network
connection.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/dr-charm/config.yaml
Preferred configuration file containing account credentials.
.SH SECURITY
Configuration files contain account credentials and should be readable only by
their owner.
